(876, 1, '2021-11-18 10:51:26', '2021-11-18 13:51:26', '<!-- wp:cms-adm/destack-buttons {\"title\":[\"\\u003cp\\u003eGASTRONOMIA\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"\\u003cp\\u003e  HOTELARIA\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"\\u003cp\\u003e     HOSPITAL\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"\\u003cp\\u003e         POLÍCIA\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"\\u003cp\\u003e     \\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eEVENTOS\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"\\u003cp\\u003e           LOCAIS\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"\\u003cp\\u003e     SERVIÇOS\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"\\u003cp\\u003e    COMÉRCIO\\u003c/p\\u003e\"],\"url\":[\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\"]} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cms-adm-destack-buttons  destack-buttons-block\"><a class=\"destack-buttons text-decoration-none\" href=\"\"><img src=\"https://novosite.toledo.pr.gov.br/wp-content/themes/cityhalltoledo/images/logotoledo.png\"/><div class=\"txt\"><p>GASTRONOMIA</p></div></a><a class=\"destack-buttons text-decoration-none\" href=\"\"><img src=\"https://novosite.toledo.pr.gov.br/wp-content/themes/cityhalltoledo/images/logotoledo.png\"/><div class=\"txt\"><p>  HOTELARIA</p></div></a><a class=\"destack-buttons text-decoration-none\" href=\"\"><img src=\"https://novosite.toledo.pr.gov.br/wp-content/themes/cityhalltoledo/images/logotoledo.png\"/><div class=\"txt\"><p>     HOSPITAL</p><p></p></div></a><a class=\"destack-buttons text-decoration-none\" href=\"\"><img src=\"https://novosite.toledo.pr.gov.br/wp-content/themes/cityhalltoledo/images/logotoledo.png\"/><div class=\"txt\"><p>         POLÍCIA</p></div></a><a class=\"destack-buttons text-decoration-none\" href=\"\"><img src=\"https://novosite.toledo.pr.gov.br/wp-content/themes/cityhalltoledo/images/logotoledo.png\"/><div class=\"txt\"><p>     </p><p>EVENTOS</p></div></a><a class=\"destack-buttons text-decoration-none\" href=\"\"><img src=\"https://novosite.toledo.pr.gov.br/wp-content/themes/cityhalltoledo/images/logotoledo.png\"/><div class=\"txt\"><p>           LOCAIS</p></div></a><a class=\"destack-buttons text-decoration-none\" href=\"\"><img src=\"https://novosite.toledo.pr.gov.br/wp-content/themes/cityhalltoledo/images/logotoledo.png\"/><div class=\"txt\"><p>     SERVIÇOS</p></div></a><a class=\"destack-buttons text-decoration-none\" href=\"\"><img src=\"https://novosite.toledo.pr.gov.br/wp-content/themes/cityhalltoledo/images/logotoledo.png\"/><div class=\"txt\"><p>    COMÉRCIO</p></div></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:cms-adm/destack-buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:cms-adm/title-text {\"title\":[\"PERGUNTAS \"],\"description\":[\"\"]} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cms-adm-title-text text-data-block\"><div class=\"title-text-block\"><h2>PERGUNTAS </h2><label></label></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cms-adm/title-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:cms-adm/menu-accordion-double {\"title\":[[\"O QUE FAZER?\",\"ONDE IR?\",\"ONDE COMER?\"],[\"QUAL A MELHOR PRAÇA?\",\"\"]],\"description\":[[\"\\u003cp\\u003eO municipio de Toledo possui diversas preças e comércios que podem ser frequentados, uma boa opção de lazer é o \\u003cstrong\\u003eParque Ecológico Diva Paim Barth\\u003c/strong\\u003e, mais conhecido com \\u0022Lago\\u0022, lá também possui possui diversas praças de alimentação (\\u003cem\\u003efood trucks\\u003c/em\\u003e).\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"\\u003cp\\u003eO Shopping Panambi, é uma exelente opção para frequentar, locaizado em uma região com diversos pontos de lazer, uma das regiões mais badaladas de Toledo, Locaizado na R. Haroldo Hamilton, 478 - Centro, Toledo - PR, 85905-390, o Shopping possui diversas praças de alimentação, cinema e comércio de eletrônicos, moda, acessórios, e muito mais.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"\"],[\"\\u003cp\\u003eUma boa opção de lazer é o \\u003cstrong\\u003eParque Ecológico Diva Paim Barth\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"\"]],\"timenumber\":[\"0_left\",\"0_right\"]} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cms-adm-menu-accordion-double row menu-accordion-double-block w-100 d-flex\"><div class=\"w-50 ps-0 pe-2\"><div class=\"accordion w-100 accordion-col\" id=\"accordionSection_0_left_0\"><div class=\"accordion-item accordion-flush  bg-3\"><h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-button collapsed bg-3 color-1\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse_0_0\">O QUE FAZER?</button></h2><div class=\"accordion-collapse collapse border\" id=\"collapse_0_0\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionSection_0_left_0\"><div class=\"accordion-body bg-0 color-1\"><p>O municipio de Toledo possui diversas preças e comércios que podem ser frequentados, uma boa opção de lazer é o <strong>Parque Ecológico Diva Paim Barth</strong>, mais conhecido com \"Lago\", lá também possui possui diversas praças de alimentação (<em>food trucks</em>).</p></div></div></div><div class=\"accordion-item accordion-flush  bg-3\"><h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-button collapsed bg-3 color-1\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse_0_1\">ONDE IR?</button></h2><div class=\"accordion-collapse collapse border\" id=\"collapse_0_1\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionSection_0_left_0\"><div class=\"accordion-body bg-0 color-1\"><p>O Shopping Panambi, é uma exelente opção para frequentar, locaizado em uma região com diversos pontos de lazer, uma das regiões mais badaladas de Toledo, Locaizado na R. Haroldo Hamilton, 478 - Centro, Toledo - PR, 85905-390, o Shopping possui diversas praças de alimentação, cinema e comércio de eletrônicos, moda, acessórios, e muito mais.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"accordion-item accordion-flush  bg-3\"><h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-button collapsed bg-3 color-1\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse_0_2\">ONDE COMER?</button></h2><div class=\"accordion-collapse collapse border\" id=\"collapse_0_2\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionSection_0_left_0\"><div class=\"accordion-body bg-0 color-1\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"w-50 ps-2 pe-0\"><div class=\"accordion w-100 accordion-col\" id=\"accordionSection_0_right_1\"><div class=\"accordion-item accordion-flush  bg-3\"><h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-button collapsed bg-3 color-1\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse_1_0\">QUAL A MELHOR PRAÇA?</button></h2><div class=\"accordion-collapse collapse border\" id=\"collapse_1_0\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionSection_0_right_1\"><div class=\"accordion-body bg-0 color-1\"><p>Uma boa opção de lazer é o <strong>Parque Ecológico Diva Paim Barth</strong></p></div></div></div><div class=\"accordion-item accordion-flush  bg-3\"><h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-button collapsed bg-3 color-1\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse_1_1\"></button></h2><div class=\"accordion-collapse collapse border\" id=\"collapse_1_1\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionSection_0_right_1\"><div class=\"accordion-body bg-0 color-1\"></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cms-adm/menu-accordion-double -->\n\n<!-- wp:cms-adm/title-text {\"title\":[\"PRECISA DE AJUDA?\"],\"description\":[\"\"]} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cms-adm-title-text text-data-block\"><div class=\"title-text-block\"><h2>PRECISA DE AJUDA?</h2><label></label></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cms-adm/title-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:cms-adm/topic-text-data {\"title\":[\"TELEFONE\",\"WHATSAPP\",\"E-MAIL\",\"ATENDIMENTO\",\"ENDEREÇO\"],\"description\":[\"(45) 3055-3030\",\"(45) 9 9999-3030\",\"turista@toledo.pr,gov.br\",\"Segunda-Feira a Sexta-Feira - 08:00 ás 11:30 / 13:30 ás 17:30\",\"Rua, n° - bairro\"]} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cms-adm-topic-text-data text-data\"><div class=\"text-data\"><h4>TELEFONE</h4><label>(45) 3055-3030</label></div><div class=\"text-data\"><h4>WHATSAPP</h4><label>(45) 9 9999-3030</label></div><div class=\"text-data\"><h4>E-MAIL</h4><label>turista@toledo.pr,gov.br</label></div><div class=\"text-data\"><h4>ATENDIMENTO</h4><label>Segunda-Feira a Sexta-Feira - 08:00 ás 11:30 / 13:30 ás 17:30</label></div><div class=\"text-data\"><h4>ENDEREÇO</h4><label>Rua, n° - bairro</label></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cms-adm/topic-text-data -->', '', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '725-revision-v1', '', '', '2021-11-18 10:51:26', '2021-11-18 13:51:26', '', 725, 'https://novosite.toledo.pr.gov.br/?p=876', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
