s_2017 </label></div></div><div class=\"pdf-mini-bloco block-by-4 mx-2 \" style=\"max-width:280px\"><div><canvas id=\"canvas_pdf-mini-300_4\" class=\"canvas-pdf-image mx-auto d-block\" style=\"border:solid 1px gray;width:244px;height:316px\"></canvas><label style=\"width:100%;background-color:inherit;color:inherit\">atas_2018 </label></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cms-adm/mini-pdf -->', 'teste', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '945-revision-v1', '', '', '2021-11-29 16:02:26', '2021-11-29 19:02:26', '', 945, 'https://novosite.toledo.pr.gov.br/?p=1844', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
