(3151, 4, '2021-12-22 08:56:30', '2021-12-22 11:56:30', '<!-- wp:cms-adm/separator -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cms-adm-separator separator-green\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:cms-adm/separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:cms-adm/menu-accordion -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cms-adm-menu-accordion accordion-single accordion w-100\" id=\"accordionSection_undefined\"><div class=\"accordion-item accordion-flush bg-3 \"><h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion  \"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-button collapsed bg-3 color-1\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse_0\">Qual a diferença entre impostos federais, estaduais e municipais?</button></h2><div class=\"accordion-collapse collapse border\" id=\"collapse_0\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionSection_0\"><div class=\"accordion-body bg-0\"><p><strong>Impostos Federais</strong> –  São responsáveis por cerca de 60% das arrecadações do país. São eles: <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://blog.magnetis.com.br/iof/\" target=\"_blank\">IOF</a>, II, IPI, IRPF, <a href=\"https://www.contabilizei.com.br/contabilidade-online/irpj-imposto-de-renda-pessoa-juridica/\">IRPJ</a>, Cofins, PIS / Pasep, CSLL, INSS.</p><p><strong>Impostos Estaduais:</strong> São responsáveis por cerca de 28% das arrecadações do país, sendo eles: ICMS, IPVA, ITCMD.</p><p><strong>Impostos Municipais:</strong>  São responsáveis por cerca de 5,5% das arrecadações do país. São eles: IPTU, ISS, ITBI.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"accordion-item accordion-flush bg-3 \"><h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion  \"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-button collapsed bg-3 color-1\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse_1\"></button></h2><div class=\"accordion-collapse collapse border\" id=\"collapse_1\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionSection_0\"><div class=\"accordion-body bg-0\"></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cms-adm/menu-accordion -->\n\n<!-- wp:cms-adm/separator -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cms-adm-separator separator-green\"></div>\n<!-- 