oto_fabio_ulsenheimer_3</h4><div class=\"color-1 w-100 text-end text-break\" style=\"color:white;text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px #000000;background-color:inherit\"></div></div></div><div class=\"carousel-item rounded \" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background-image:url(https://novosite.toledo.pr.gov.br/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/acoes_dengue_independencia_020221_foto_fabio_ulsenheimer_6_1-scaled.jpg);background-size:Cover;background-position:center center\"><div class=\"carousel-caption color-1 w-100\" style=\"top:calc(100% - 25px);right:10px;left:auto\"><h4 class=\"color-1 w-100 text-end text-break\" style=\"text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px #000000\">acoes_dengue_independencia_020221_foto_fabio_ulsenheimer_6_1</h4><div class=\"color-1 w-100 text-end text-break\" style=\"color:white;text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px #000000;background-color:inherit\"></div></div></div></div><button class=\"carousel-control-prev\" data-bs-target=\"#carousel873\" data-bs-slide=\"prev\"><spam class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></spam></button><button class=\"carousel-control-next\" data-bs-target=\"#carousel873\" data-bs-slide=\"next\"><spam class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></spam></button></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cms-adm/slide-show -->', 'LIRAA APONTA ÍNDICE ACIMA DO PRECONIZADO PELO MINISTÉRIO DA SAÚDE', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'liraa-aponta-indice-acima-do-preconizado-pelo-ministerio-da-saude', '', '', '2022-01-10 08:09:21', '2022-01-10 11:09:21', '', 0, 'https://novosite.toledo.pr.gov.br/?p=3736', 0, 'post', '', 0);
